                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">527ac6f8-29a0-4063-8ff3-0056002068fe</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 1  -  Slice into floors
Goal: one outline at every floor line, cut from the tower mass.
Idea: Contour slices a solid with parallel planes at a fixed
   spacing: the Floor-to-floor height.
Watch for: The direction defaults to Z (up), so the slices are
   horizontal.
Wire check: Floor-to-floor -&gt; D (distance).</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>3103.7842</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>258.90625</W>
                          <H>80.541016</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>3108.7842</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
