                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 3  -  Point it down
Goal: a vector as long as the slab is thick, pointing down.
Idea: The same Unit Z as Level B: a negative factor makes it
   point down.
Watch for: Unit X and Unit Y would push the slabs sideways.</item>
                  </items>
