                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 5  -  Close the slabs
Goal: solid slabs: lids on each extrusion.
Idea: Extruding a closed curve leaves the top and bottom open,
   just like Loft did.
Watch for: The same Cap Holes as Level B: recall it.</item>
                  </items>
