                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 6  -  Check the floor areas
Goal: the area of every floor plate in sf.
Idea: Area on flat closed curves gives the enclosed area: the
   floor plate per level, the first number a client asks for.
Watch for: Drag Top radius: upper floors shrink and their areas
   drop.</item>
