                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">5a9af4e2-4159-49b0-b4c6-d03abf498efc</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL C - Create the floors  |  C01 (Simple method)  |  Twisty tower series - WALKTHROUGH.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for (common mistakes)  -  Wire check (which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = built in an earlier level, pre-placed, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red C01_Q## is the question node.
Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.  Built only from components the PathOGen solver supports.
Questions: C01_Q01 Contour   C01_Q02 Multiplication   C01_Q03 Unit Z   C01_Q04 Extrude   C01_Q05 Cap Holes   C01_Q06 Area</item>
                  </items>
